Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummoo, yummoo, yummoo, yummoo, yummoo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The directions we got\Nfrom Joey's dual discs at
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber Corp Stadium is\Nabout two blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are we parking all the way\Nback here in Nowheresville, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So when the finals are over,\Nwe won't get stuck in traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah, good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get over there and see\Nwho else made it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like you're getting\Nanother shot at a tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,championship after not quite making\Nthe cut last time. That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and this time I plan to crush you and\NYugi in front of a sold-out crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, there's something I've\Nbeen meaning to ask you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you save my hide in\Nthe Duelist Kingdom finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up off the floor, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.87,0:01:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And quit all your crying already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid thing won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, just don't go\Nblowing your nose in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya told me about your little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How you're dueling to win the prize\Nmoney so she can have that operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounded like a bad soap\Nopera, to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but then who doesn't\Nlove a bad soap opera?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, see you around, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's tournament entry card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have been kicked right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked totally pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I guess I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was touched by your story\Nand I wanted to help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you pay attention? Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But look, it's Jean-Claude\NMagnum's latest ninja flick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta see this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I even\Nbother trying to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding driving like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Around here, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope my entrance didn't spook you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that the\Nsame guy in the poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, him, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Jean-Claude Magnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your number one fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of a celebrity myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, second place, Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Sugar. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see I've come back for you, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Slick, but you've\Ngot the wrong girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me your pals were\NHollywood's ninth biggest box office draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My, sugar, have you forgotten the\Noffer you made me exactly one year ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an offer of love, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the rest\Nof your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your only mistake was\Nchallenging me to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you duel\Nsomeone at your own level?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The kiddie room's downstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got spunk. I like\Na girl who can stand up to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,me and tell me what's on\Nher mind Take this ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, and be my wife What\Ndo you say, sweetums?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mai, wait Ask me again when\Nyou can beat me in duel monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.49,0:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, guess it's too late\Nto say I was kidding, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come here today to make you the\Nluckiest girl in the entire world, Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean-Claude Magnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ninja Boy, I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, slow down there, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The least you could do\Nis consider his offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Mai, he's a movie star, and\Nyou're always craving attention, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one good reason why\NI should marry this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't marry him, I won't be\Nable to visit your Beverly Hills mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to come back when\NI can beat you in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let's settle\Nthis with a duel, hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I win, you'll come back to\NHollywood with me and become my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance, Ace. Mai, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're already going to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't duel this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to bring this up, but Jean-Claude\NMagnum has some serious kung fu skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be wise to get him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai will win in no time and\Nwe'll still make the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you should duel him, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a second ago, you\Ntold me I should marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do me a favor and let Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja borrow your duel disc, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.09,0:05:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a duel disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But duel discs are only supposed to\Nbe issued to high-ranked duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says I'm not high-ranked, Shorty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is, I've won five locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean if Mai loses this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll lose a locator card\Nand her slot in the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, that's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take her place in the finals,\Nnot to mention her hand in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to accept\Nthis guy's challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth risking the finals for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's right, Mai. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to show Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hollywood Ninja Boy that I'm\Nnot just some prize to be won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then prepare to lose this duel,\Nbut win a husband who's a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Mai is\Nrisking her spot in the Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.51,0:06:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked just to show\Nup to Jean-Claude Magna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Dollface, when I win,\Nyou marry me. Now let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Ninja Commander\NAkusa in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He kind of looks like me,\Nbut my physique is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feast your eyes on my Ninja\NCommander's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's probably just\Nsome Hollywood special effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called multiplicity, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as I keep my ninja\Ncommander in attack mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can summon ninja soldier\Nkatana to the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sound so confident,\Nyou B-movie hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters are just like your movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Second rate and not around\Nfor very long. Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad reviews aren't always easy to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, let's see how\Nyour ninjas like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,my Amazon Sword Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Slice and dice his ninja soldier\Nwith your Amazon Slash attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's not like he is in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean-Claude duels like an\Namateur, and not only that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,he's much shorter than he looks on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that you haven't changed\Nyour aggressive style of dueling,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my little sweet pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still as charming as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I play another Ninja Commander here in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,attack mode and just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,like before i'll use his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,special ability to summon\Nanother ninja soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to the field your dueling is just one bad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,sequel after another that attitude only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,makes me love you even\Nmore i think that mai's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,really cool don't you joey she's so tough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to be like that. Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she doesn't let anyone\Npush her around. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think it's cool to have a\Nreally loud mouth, a mean disposition,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and to walk around acting like you're\Nthe greatest thing since cheese fries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,sure, I guess you could say mice cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar Plum, were you\Ndaydreaming about our wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather eat worms, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Amazon Sword Woman,\Nattack his ninja commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you've walked\Nright into the trap I set, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've sent my ninja commander\Nand my ninja soldier to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,all I have to do is sacrifice one\Nmore ninja and you're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja soldier, buh-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to bring out the real star.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Ninja Master Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise, more ninjas.\NEver think about trying a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,different role you ain't seen\Nnothing yet when my ninja
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,master's in attack mode he\Ncan summon two more ninjas so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,meet ninja a commando kabuki\Nand another ninja soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And in another plot twist, my kabuki ninja\Ncan also summon a monster to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's Kunoichi Ayame, the ninja girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's four ninjas for the price of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, does this mean\NMai's in trouble? Nah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll take a lot more\Nthan a bunch as second
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-rate ninjas to stop a duelist like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know\Nfirsthand how good she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja Master, attack her. Amazon Swordwoman,\Nwith your merciless flame attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my four ninjas, attack my\Nfuture wife's life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my little ginger snap, but\Nthat's the price you pay for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,when I defeat you, at least you'll have\Na husband who's a Battle City finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You could brag about me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so sensitive, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop flirting, Midas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much on the line over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll have to marry this creep and forfeit\Nher place in the Battle City finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down and\Nready my ninja army for a final attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true what they say, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you have to\Ndestroy the ones you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are wide\Nopen for attack, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your claws, my cyber harpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to leave you at the altar,\Nbut I'm not losing this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber harpy, scratch out his ninja master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You set off my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Unleash ninja smokeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your attack\Nhas just been blocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,which means your ladybird's got\Nto take her claws off of my ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My, crush this wannabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish with one card face\Ndown, and it's back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we'll be walking down the\Naisle together sooner than I'd expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be limping down the aisle\Nalone when I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you bitter because\NHollywood's hottest celebrity
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,is about to take your place\Nin the Battle City Finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe my magic card. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Kite of Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hovering overhead,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,my Ninja Master is protected from all\Nof your monster attacks and magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My kite also allows my ninja to bypass\Nany of your monsters and attack your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,life points directly as long as I\Nsacrifice one of my own monsters first
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I'll sacrifice my\Nninja soldier and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,your life points with my\Nninja master's thunder attack
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, we're almost done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can start planning our\Nhoneymoon on Waikiki Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I I wouldn't pick your best man just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's gonna get bumped from the finals\Nand then she'll have to marry this jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, can Mai turn this around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If she plays Harpy's Feather Duster,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it would cancel out all active magic\Ncards on the playing field, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't happen to have a Harpy's\NFeather Duster in your hand, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I would've used it by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, what do you think I should\Nwear to your Hollywood wedding, huh, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's a magic card that'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just get this over with, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is money, and the finals await.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we need a plan before\Nthat flying ninja attacks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai should focus on destroying\Nthe ninjas on the ground first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, he has to sacrifice\Nthem to attack her life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but if she wipes them out\Nfirst, she'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai, I got some great\Nninja-destroying advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I can do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to help\Nyou win so you wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,have to miss out on\Nthe Battle City Finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Grumpenheimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep your big mouth zipped or\NI'll stick your dual disc in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got to get rid of\Nthose other three ninjas now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,One more direct attack and\Nher life points are history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's goodbye Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.03,0:14:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And hello, Mrs. Magnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all behind you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I get the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do like the Mai I know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, no more Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice. My.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I play a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Elegant Egotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns one harpy into three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.39,0:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out his ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to bug me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking to me, ninja nerd?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you leave this duel to\Nthe grown-ups, you little twerp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push me, Claude, or I'll show you\Na few ninja moves of my own, you big ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd do the same for any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That whole tough guy\Nroutine is really cute, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mai's a big girl now, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't need the whole\Nplay group looking out for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, pal, the name's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that remark of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can consider my membership in the\NJean-Claude Magnum fan club canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll survive somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But the money and fame just\Nwon't feel the same without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you two are done, I'm\Nplacing one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember my ninja girl, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I sacrifice her, my Ninja Master will\Nfinish you off for good! Aw, no! Aw, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:16:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm about to cut your Ninja Girl from\Nthe scene with my Grave Arm Magic Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It sends her directly\Nto the card graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no monsters to sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot one very important thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That kite up there may protect your\Nninja master from being attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but it also takes your\Nmonster out of all the action,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,including defending your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that you're wide\Nopen for a direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can cancel those\Nwedding plans because
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be busy at the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Cyber Harpies, finish\Noff this washed-up has-been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life points directly\Nwith your triple scratch attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you two thumbs down, movie boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've learned I'm\Nnot a prize to be won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm missing the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a joke, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're missing it, that's\Nprobably because the joke's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop reciting your lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my life now. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But the duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All the dueling holograms\Nshould have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I don't\Nthink that's a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That flying ninja's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the world of Hollywood special\Neffects, where anything can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out, you sore loser. My!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't win your heart, my, then\NI'm just gonna have to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get her down quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:18:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down now, you ninja freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs help, but I've\Ngot no idea what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai, come on, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? No way! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Joey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, here, take my hand, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.73,0:18:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even do your\Nown stunts, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So does this mean our\Nwedding plans are off, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a cheap\NHollywood phony, Jean-Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The only real action hero around\Nhere is right there, resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:18:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:18:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But you could have married a movie star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did that, I wouldn't be able to\Nkick your butt in the finals, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, if you ever did get married,\Nyou'd drive your husband crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to be all right, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get inside that stadium\Nand do what we all came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City Finals start tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,May the best man win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean woman.
